  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ante Up</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you ready an action, you may increase your ante by 1. Add half your ante to a single d20 roll made as part of a readied action. If your readied action is not triggered at all, you lose ante and suffer backlash as if you had rolled a natural 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
